      "message": "i don\u0027t think it\u0027s that heavy weight, considering this isn\u0027t called the often. for zinger, we can just define an empty mutex_lock()/unlock() function.",
      "parentUuid": "ee823118_ea22670c",
      "revId": "71c313ab268dd5626e305fa2a38710495b43b9ce",
